		{"id":"17e8998e3f089838","type":"text","text":"Cat recruits Leo and Tullia to come with explore -> by boat or land? Sammy stays behind. He is the only one who knows what they are up to. Cat only tells her dad they'll be out for the day. ","x":-285,"y":-160,"width":250,"height":180},
		{"id":"a41c5b1bb5c1b65e","type":"text","text":"They pass by Camie's bakery to gather some goods without telling her where they're going.","x":-285,"y":40,"width":250,"height":100},
		{"id":"24ceeba436f474fd","type":"text","text":"They leave in the morning to go investigate the sounds. ","x":-285,"y":160,"width":250,"height":60},
